{"title":"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Brute_Force)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Brute Force)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2><p>\nGiven that </p><center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/d/16d26af464ce4b8d84de3933589ddc93c5d5b57e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 1{2!17!}+\\frac 1{3!16!}+\\frac 1{4!15!}+\\frac 1{5!14!}+\\frac 1{6!13!}+\\frac 1{7!12!}+\\frac 1{8!11!}+\\frac 1{9!10!}=\\frac N{1!18!}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"550\" height=\"38\" /></center><p> find the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Floor_function\" title=\"Floor function\">greatest integer</a> that is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906f8cc902573d5cdd36e0e752d957d8df3d413e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac N{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"29\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/a/76a2b2aaeda3bb0000156738164faab20ae9f138.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19!$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> yields: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/2/512c6a00ae7e316e65fee4284136007504350d26.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac {19!}{2!17!}+\\frac {19!}{3!16!}+\\frac {19!}{4!15!}+\\frac {19!}{5!14!}+\\frac {19!}{6!13!}+\\frac {19!}{7!12!}+\\frac {19!}{8!11!}+\\frac {19!}{9!10!}=\\frac {19!N}{1!18!}.\\]\" width=\"499\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/e/e3e8008bba65f49823f5d64af9b96e7d8ec7dedc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\binom{19}{2}+\\binom{19}{3}+\\binom{19}{4}+\\binom{19}{5}+\\binom{19}{6}+\\binom{19}{7}+\\binom{19}{8}+\\binom{19}{9} = 19N.\\]\" width=\"527\" height=\"53\" /> \n</p><p>Recall the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Combinatorial_identity\" title=\"Combinatorial identity\">Combinatorial Identity</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/9/4d91c252329de50a00351bab06a345996f77eded.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{19} = \\sum_{n=0}^{19} {19 \\choose n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"118\" height=\"53\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/e/d4e53f3b8ef55f9f7761b6fa578a499e47e9f969.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${19 \\choose n} = {19 \\choose 19-n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"146\" height=\"53\" />, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/1/2318df7c1efa6814346c7fbd9e92462e05ddf138.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{n=0}^{9} {19 \\choose n} = \\frac{2^{19}}{2} = 2^{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"172\" height=\"53\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/9/e790a7f9037dd7c4afb07a7947897f4a80ac4145.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19N = 2^{18}-\\binom{19}{1}-\\binom{19}{0}=2^{18}-19-1 = (2^9)^2-20 = (512)^2-20 = 262124$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"633\" height=\"53\" />.\n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/3/a7313eb4409799666bda2dcde26aff23d04b3f89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=\\frac{262124}{19}=13796$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"171\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/8/6f840ce8db384377623585238a773c1c2b4849b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor \\frac{N}{100} \\right\\rfloor =\\boxed{137}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"115\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/7/a27a089aee35fd1eeebe0633cde62ca1309ccdfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = (1+x)^{19}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"21\" /> Applying the binomial theorem gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/4/1f4becb5b75c14b711248d6e0ac567f94e7e3b9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\binom{19}{19} x^{19} + \\binom{19}{18} x^{18} + \\binom{19}{17} x^{17}+ \\cdots + \\binom{19}{0}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"435\" height=\"55\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/8/008a62190a58faf4801ba823495fed0c93ea0866.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 1{2!17!}+\\frac 1{3!16!}+\\dots+\\frac 1{8!11!}+\\frac 1{9!10!} = \\frac{\\frac{f(1)}{2} - \\binom{19}{19} - \\binom{19}{18}}{19!},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"443\" height=\"45\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/2/21288a74ab4c43243d203a1454aae35716d19ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = \\frac{2^{18}-20}{19}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"115\" height=\"41\" /> After some fairly easy bashing, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/b/e0b1b3226d0a1900354697f87c947f83f8835816.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{137}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" /> as the answer.\n</p><p>~peelybonehead\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Brute_Force.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Brute_Force)\">Solution 3 (Brute Force)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Brute Force)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Convert each denominator to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/0/980652235199d55d04b7f9da22c5ac8cb491234c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18!$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> and get the numerators to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/e/53ed652feaa8b9e8694109d27bec0a206234e487.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9,51,204,612,1428,2652,3978,4862$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"286\" height=\"17\" /> (refer to note). Adding these up we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/f/2afe67588f849c9a80599fa3118985adb8af13a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13796$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" /> therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/b/e0b1b3226d0a1900354697f87c947f83f8835816.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{137}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" /> is the desired answer.\n</p><p>Note:\nNotice that each numerator is increased each time by a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/c/b4cd99e2b3eeab23b339809e14fa0387d2405264.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{17}{3}, \\frac{16}{4}, \\frac{15}{5}, \\frac{14}{6},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"120\" height=\"38\" /> etc. until <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/e/e4ee7535b22d537392bc21c1c9b951f6f661e058.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{11}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />. If you were taking the test under normal time conditions, it shouldn't be too hard to bash out all of the numbers but it is priority to be careful.\n</p><p>~SirAppel, Danny Wang (ThePeeps191)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II\" title=\"2000 AIME II\">2000 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2000\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017114547\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 193/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1806/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4862/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.298      1 -total\n 58.55%    7.200      1 Template:AIME_box\n 39.66%    4.878      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3152:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017114547 and revision id 290293. Re